commentary = Array[String](["I'm glad your new computer didn't hide me. You couldn't miss the view.", "The best to help reach high places. But he's actually raising you to get things.", "I heard he's Malory's best friend. They must workout together.", "Never misses yoga tuesdays. But he can't touch the middle of his back. Too buff.", "He always takes so many showers on the company. How many times does he take a break to exercise?"])
